  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6fd443df-89ff-5026-bf6c-6dfee0502239" activityNameId="27b661a5-ff06-584f-a656-b11fa3993737" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lithium hexafluorophosphate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lithium hexafluorophosphate, at plant
The dataset can be used as conductive salt for a lithium-ion battery. Data are based on patents. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted. Transportation efforts are based on ecoinvent standard estimates.;
CAS number: 021324-40-3; 
Formula: LiPF6; 
UUID: 4e1f9dc6-3979-370a-91f0-465f524145d3
This dataset includes the reaction of lithium fluoride, phosphorous pentachloride and hydrogen fluoride in an autoclave to lithium hexafluorophosphate and hydrogen chloride. Conversion factor for lithium  is 86.7%. The reaction temperatur is -78°C. Assumption: Cooling happens with a heat pump (coefficient of performance = 1.5). Neutralisation of hydrogen flouride and hydrogen chloride with potassium hydroxide. Phosphorous trifluoride is proxy for phosphorous pentafluoride for emission to air. Transports according to ecoinvent standards.For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted.
Location: Some Swiss or  European datasets are used for global processes.
Technology: This dataset includes the reaction of lithium fluoride, phosphorous pentachloride and hydrogen fluoride in an autoclave to lithium hexafluorophosphate and hydrogen chloride. Conversion factor for lithium  is 86.7%. The reaction temperatur is -78°C. Assumption: Cooling happens with a heat pump (coefficient of performance = 1.5). Neutralisation of hydrogen flouride and hydrogen chloride with potassium hydroxide. Phosphorous trifluoride is proxy for phosphorous pentafluoride for emission to air.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: patent, website, ecoinvent 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is assessed using the pedigree matrix.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4e1f9dc6-3979-370a-91f0-465f524145d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
